e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qCdASEI3XYUQ7kNvwGHCbaN&_nc_oc=AdqL8CkYk445uxmncjkpi2G1kDJnU0vGqc6eFfD1WadTN26s-4-cTF1-k-MelFh0Rfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0bwXULPTgbblRqmqnRzxG5It4mfrUltagM8p-RsWpsHQ&oe=69F201D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PsSPwGzLTAIQ7kNvwGX2sPB&_nc_oc=Adq4VnVd6v6Tt4cYLp4h6vr2a5CALycmMbbrSec7dCpmnWJ4naWq7XAA2vfL95zXgUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0wU2j88DAn0nosG2ApfweIrRrzpYMejcms82RQP6DhZA&oe=69F206B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ui2CmefkFacQ7kNvwFSu1jg&_nc_oc=AdpiIeZAYJOojI3R_N21d-QRjtgIr3wyf4KVJPmykfzxT2dNrVgJu_e2fe4vsAej7C4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0wClAG_NdnVaTf-K1V8e1E59ky--pn8euCMTN0BvQ-Jg&oe=69F21455"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162769_291770251331620_2676753636117184512_n.pn